{"version":1,"content":"<p>90年代「性感女神」邱淑貞與沈嘉偉婚後育有三女，其中大女沈月及二女沈日盡得父母優良基因，一向是外界焦點。</p><p>近日，兩姊妹激罕合體為時尚品牌拍攝宣傳照，同框大晒超高顏值，精緻五官與靈動神韻與媽媽如出一轍，隨即引發網民熱議。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T12:20:47.807628+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T12:01:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T12:14:19.300283+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T12:14:19.300283+00:00","content_hash":"39f665edb50c3f950a8c190db521b0f31196118c811615eb66969cceb9b8f24e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}